---Remove an image from its media library. It stops appearing in the library list, but its URL keeps working, so content that already uses it (a sent email, a live template) is not broken.
---
---`DELETE /api/projects/{project_id}/uploaded_media/{id}/`
---Errors: NotFound.
---@param input posthog.uploaded_media.UploadedMediaDestroyRequest
---@return posthog.uploaded_media.UploadedMediaDestroyResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:uploaded_media_destroy(input) end

